    "longDescription": "ZLGithubClient is an open source client based on the GitHub REST API V3 and GraphQl API V4.\n\nThe basic functions are as follows:\n1. Search for open source repositories and developers you want to know\n2. Support daily/weekly/monthly open source repository and developer trending list\n3. Support to browse open source repositories (Commits, Issues, Watchers, Pull Requests, etc.). Support to fork，watch and star open source repositories\n4. Support to browse code of public and private repositories \n5. Support to browse the basic information of the developers and follow developers\n6. Support to view the latest events of  repositories followed and developers  watched\n7. Simply look up Notification\n8. Fixed repositories in the workboard\n9. Review the Issue and Pull Request processed by the logged user in the workboard",
